Class UsersRepository:
- create users
- fetch by id or (auth_provider, auth_subject)

Class DataVersionsRepository:
- create/list/get data_versions
- activate one version and deactivate the others

Class SessionsRepository:
- create session rows
- fetch one session or list sessions for one user

Class AIRunsRepository:
- create and fetch ai_run rows

Class CacheRepository:
- create cache rows
- fetch a strong-cache candidate by run_type and response_variant_hash

Class LeaderboardRepository:
- create leaderboard rows
- fetch one leaderboard scope
